  "job_B3.3.32_20251003_114718": {
    "chunk_text": "Leasingum beswicen & ofercumen, \u00fe\u00e6t he wene\u00fe fur\u00feon \u00fe\u00e6t he man se sy, ac wene\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t he sy \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fee Ac on Criste anum is ealles siges fylnes \u00feurhtogen; & \u00feurh \u00feone man \u00fee he on hine sylfne onfeng, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00deonne syndon on \u00feyssum Simone twa speda, mannes & deofles; & he \u00feonne men g\u00e6le\u00fe \u00e6lces godes \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00fe Simon to Sancte Petre, For teonan me \u00feinc\u00fe wundor; \u00feu goda casere. To hwon \u00feu sceole for owiht \u00feysne man habban ungel\u00e6redne fiscere \u00feone leasostan, & naw\u00feer ne on \u00deonne nelle ic \u00feyssum fynd leng arian, ac nu ic bebeode minum englum \u00fe\u00e6t hie cuman & me. Witnian. \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00fe Petrus, Ne ondr\u00e6de ic me \u00feine englas, ac hie magon him me ondr\u00e6don, for \u00feon m\u00e6gene \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00fe se casere, Ne ondr\u00e6dest \u00feu \u00fee Simon Petrus, se \u00fee his godcundnesse mid so\u00feum wisum Him \u00fea andswarede se eadiga apostol Sanctus Petrus & \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00fe, On \u00feam is godcundnesse wen \u00fee \u00deone ilcan ge\u00feang ic \u00fee \u00e6r s\u00e6de, \u00e6r he leoge, \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00fee leogan ne durre, o\u00fe\u00fee secge hw\u00e6t ic \u00feence. Neron cw\u00e6\u00fe, Gang me near hider, & sege me hw\u00e6t \u00feu \u00feence. Petrus cw\u00e6\u00fe, Hat me bringan berene hlaf & me degollice syllan. & syllan Sancte Petre. \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00fe Petrus, Secge Simon me nu, gif he god sy, hw\u00e6t her si ge",
